  "2026-10-16T13:18:19.979Z",codex-agent,"Design: check active nonterminal lanes before claiming. Default start returns structured warnings naming lane and both paths; strict refuses before claim/worktree publication."
  "2026-10-16T13:26:26.111Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: restoring only startLane from the base branch made the strict regression fail with Missing expected rejection; focused test exited 1 (0 pass, 1 fail). Restored implementation. Source imports require no dist rebuild."
  "2026-10-16T13:44:05.193Z",codex-agent,"Full SDK reads materialize files even when empty; removed the redundant fallback from overlap preflight. All 93 tests passed before the stronger watch synchronization check exposed a fixture race, now corrected. Thresholds remain four dimensions at 100 percent."
  "2026-10-16T13:57:30.536Z",codex-agent,"Final gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass normally and with CI=1, isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Each run: 93/93 tests plus 1/1 packed npm/native Bun acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 21 authored source files at 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines. Statements/lines 1337/1337; functions 72/72; branches 601/601 for normal npm and 600/600 for the other runs. Identity, types, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, production audit, package allowlist, changelog and publish attestation pass. Three behavioural revert proofs are recorded. Publication remains maintainer-gated."
